%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Noto Sans CJK SC, PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Bpf["BPF 程序以高频率<br/>发出事件"]
    Reserve["bpf_ringbuf_reserve(sz)"]
    Check{Reserve<br/>返回 NULL？}
    Drop["递增<br/>'drops' 计数器<br/>(BPF_MAP_TYPE<br/>_PERCPU_ARRAY)"]
    Submit["bpf_ringbuf_submit"]
    Done["return 0"]

    User["用户空间消费者<br/>定期读取<br/>drops 计数器"]
    Diag["日志：'dropped N events<br/>since last sample'"]

    Bpf --> Reserve
    Reserve --> Check
    Check -->|是，已满| Drop
    Drop --> Done
    Check -->|否| Submit
    Submit --> Done

    User -.->|读取 drops 映射| Diag

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef us fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    class Submit,Done ok
    class Drop bad
    class User,Diag us
